  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After crossing a gold fragment current in the turbulent flow sea area, Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture gains a new small gold fragment river. He places that river in Mini Yellow Heaven only to add to the scenery, judging the tiny river cannot give him benefits.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later the gold fragment river is still not big, but better than nothing.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mini Yellow Heaven remains very empty, with only a tiny gold fragment current.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within the empty Mini Yellow Heaven, Fang Yuan’s time path clone lands before a group of Gu Immortals. Other than Ying Wu Xie, his subordinates gather there, including Bai Ning Bing, Hei Lou Lan, Fairy Miao Yin, Lady White Rabbit, Xue Er, Bing Yuan, Shi Zong, Shi Shi Cheng, and Mo Tan Sang. An immortal formation they helped finish, the wisdom refinement formation, floats in the sky and runs smoothly as he strips Immortal Gu from dream-trapped captives.",
      "chapters": [
        1790
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "subordinate-gathering",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "char_lady_white_rabbit",
        "char_xue_er",
        "char_bing_yuan",
        "char_shi_zong",
        "char_shi_shi_cheng",
        "char_mo_tan_sang",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ni clan Gu Masters fight the gold fragment current in Mini Yellow Heaven. They build an embankment, dig a canal, and face river monsters that surge ashore. Brought into the sovereign immortal aperture and secretly nurtured by Fang Yuan, they unite under the strong survival pressure in Mini Yellow Heaven, hold the defensive battle, and race to finish a Gu formation meant to curb the flood. A meteor rain then shakes the gold fragment current and the cloud soil beneath them before the survivors cheer when the giant leaves.",
      "chapters": [
        2128
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ni-clan-flood-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ni_clan",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan personally strengthens Ni clan by quietly setting up a year essence sub-pool in their territory, forming a time path zone so their time passes much faster and Immortal Gu production rises. He judges that Mini Yellow Heaven’s Ni clan will probably become the top human force among humans mostly drawn from Beast Calamity grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        2135
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-essence-zone",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    }
  ],
